<classification-symbol scheme="EC">B60R  25/04C</classification-symbol></classification-ecla><invention-title load-source="docdb" status="new" lang="EN">THEFTPROOFING DEVICE OF CONSTRUCTION MACHINERY</invention-title><invention-title load-source="docdb" status="new" lang="FR">DISPOSITIF DE PROTECTION CONTRE LE VOL POUR MACHINES DE CONSTRUCTION</invention-title><citations><patent-citations><patcit ucid="JP-61229645-A" status="new"><document-id status="new"  format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>61229645</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-8318821-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>8318821</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y"  name="SEA"  created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-9050584-A"  status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>9050584</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit> </patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>None</text><sources><source name="APP" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1024066A1</text> <sources><source name="APP" created-by-npl="N"/></sources> </nplcit> </non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>CATERPILLAR MITSUBISHI LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FURUTA HIDETO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MORIYA NAOYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FURUTA, HIDETO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MORIYA, NAOYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIN CATERPILLAR MITSUBISHI LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FURUTA HIDETO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MORIYA NAOYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FURUTA, HIDETO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MORIYA, NAOYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A theftproofing device of construction machinery capable of securely preventing an engine from being started and also a hydraulic control device from being operated even if an engine start circuit is modified in the construction machinery equipped with the engine (2), the hydraulic control device (4), and a frame controller (6), wherein the initial state of the frame controller is set so that a fuel injection by a fuel injection device (2b) of the engine is stopped and the operation of the control devices of the hydraulic control device (4) is stopped, and a theftproofing control device (8) is installed so as to reset the initial state of the frame controller (6) with reset signals from the theftproofing control device (8).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif de protection contre le vol, pour machines de construction, qui permet d'empêcher, avec fiabilité, le démarrage d'un moteur et l'activation d'un système de commande hydraulique, même si l'on modifie un circuit de démarrage du moteur, dans les machines équipées du moteur considéré (2), du système de commande hydraulique considéré (4) et d'un organe de commande de châssis (6). L'état initial de cet organe de commande est établi de manière à bloquer l'injection de carburant d'un injecteur (2b) du moteur ainsi que l'activation des dispositifs de commande du système de commande hydraulique (4). Un dispositif de commande de protection contre le vol (8) est prévu, pour fournir des signaux de réinitialisation de l'état initial de l'organe de commande susmentionné (6).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>